  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "The media's composition was the following: 6.8 g L−1 NaCOOH; 4.68 g L−1 NaH2PO4; 6.5 g L−1 Na2HPO4; 0.8 g L−1 MgSO4 ⋅ 7 H2O; 0.943 g L−1 (NH4)2SO4; 0.016 g L−1 FeSO4; 1 mL −1 trace element solution (in 0.1 M HCl: 1.5 mg L−1 FeSO4 ⋅ 7 H2O; 2.4 mg L−1 MnSO4 ⋅ H2O; 2,4 mg L−1 ZnSO4 ⋅ 7 H2O; 0.48 mg L−1 CuSO4 ⋅ 5 H2O; 1.8 mg L−1 Na2MoO4 ⋅ 2 H2O; 1.5 mg L−1 Ni2SO4 ⋅ 6 H2O; 4.02 mg L−1 CoSO4 ⋅ 7 H2O)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "All media components were prepared sterile in separate stock solutions and combined prior to each experiment. The pH value was set to 6.8 with sterile H2SO4 and NaOH."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
